https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/boeing-b-52-stratofortress-38b0c64bd552431394efa8625d7f5144
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The downloaded mesh depicts a later Stratofortress configuration. The two
trailing-edge panels between its flap sections have been split out to
represent the B-52F ailerons. They pivot with the corresponding JSBSim roll
control outputs. The remaining mesh is fixed, including the landing gear.
